{"id":"2ba9a251dffb583e","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-mlrandom-nu.md","title":"可计算测度的 Martin-Löf 随机性","display":"df-mlrandom-nu — 可计算测度的 Martin-Löf 随机性","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","aliases":["43-df-mlrandom-nu"],"display":"df-mlrandom-nu — 可计算测度的 Martin-Löf 随机性","label":"43-df-mlrandom-nu","type":"definition","depends_on":["[[43-df-mltestnu]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§9.9，印刷198–201，PDF218–221","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-mlrandom-nu</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-mlrandom-nu — 可计算测度的 Martin-Löf 随机性"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-mlrandom-nu"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"35c96ed38b162487\" href=\"?note=35c96ed38b162487\" title=\"43-df-mltestnu\">43-df-mltestnu</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§9.9，印刷198–201，PDF218–221"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"35c96ed38b162487\" href=\"?note=35c96ed38b162487\" title=\"43-df-mltestnu\">43-df-mltestnu</a> 规定的可计算Borel概率测度；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}_{\\nu}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}_{\\nu}\\)</span> 是以固定可计算概率测度ν为参数的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上布尔谓词，以下Assertion给出其定义。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLTest}_{\\nu}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLTest}_{\\nu}\\)</span> 是以当前固定可计算概率测度ν为参数的开集序列上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"35c96ed38b162487\" href=\"?note=35c96ed38b162487\" title=\"43-df-mltestnu\">43-df-mltestnu</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}_{\\nu}(X)\\iff\\forall U\\;\\left(\\mathrm{MLTest}_{\\nu}(U)\\Rightarrow X\\notin\\bigcap_nU_n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MLRandom}_{\\nu}(X)\\iff\\forall U\\;\\left(\\mathrm{MLTest}_{\\nu}(U)\\Rightarrow X\\notin\\bigcap_nU_n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>公平硬币测度是此定义的特例；带原子测度允许可计算点随机，故不得将Lebesgue测度下的非可计算性结论无条件迁移。</p>\n<p>来源：§9.9，印刷198–201，PDF218–221。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-mltestnu","status":"resolved","id":"35c96ed38b162487","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mltestnu]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mltestnu","status":"resolved","id":"35c96ed38b162487","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$，$\\nu$ 是 [[43-df-mltestnu]] 规定的可计算Borel概率测度；$U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mltestnu","status":"resolved","id":"35c96ed38b162487","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MLRandom}_{\\nu}$ 是以固定可计算概率测度ν为参数的 $2^\\omega$ 上布尔谓词，以下Assertion给出其定义。\n$\\mathrm{MLTest}_{\\nu}$ 是以当前固定可计算概率测度ν为参数的开集序列上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-mltestnu]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLRandom}_{\\nu}","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLTest}_{\\nu}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLRandom}_{\\nu}(X)\\iff\\forall U\\;\\left(\\mathrm{MLTest}_{\\nu}(U)\\Rightarrow X\\notin\\bigcap_nU_n\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1386,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-180","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom-nu]] — 可计算测度的 Martin-Löf 随机性"},{"id":"38b337ed607def8b","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\nu$ 是可计算Borel概率测度，$X\\in2^\\omega$ 且 $\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(X)$；相关定义见 [[43-df-compmeasure]]、[[43-df-measure-atoms]]、[[43-df-computable]]、[[43-df-mlrandom-nu]]、[[43-df-mltestnu]]、[[43-df-cylinder]]。"},{"id":"620117fc884bad92","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\nu$ 为可计算Borel概率测度且 $\\operatorname{ContinuousMeasure}(\\nu)$，$A\\in2^\\omega$。$\\equiv_T$ 按二进制序列与特征集合识别解释；相关定义见 [[43-df-compmeasure]]、[[43-df-measure-atoms]]、[[43-df-mlrandom-nu]]、[[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"7f929e689547cc3b","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\nu$ 是可计算Borel概率测度，$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)$、$\\operatorname{MLTest}_\\nu$、$\\operatorname{MLRandom}_\\nu$ 见 [[43-df-measure-atoms]]、[[43-df-mltestnu]]、[[43-df-mlrandom-nu]]。"}],"outgoing":["35c96ed38b162487"]}